# Python packages for scripts/build_release_dmg.py, installed by the Release workflow and
# scripts/kickstart.sh with `pip install --require-hashes --only-binary :all:`. The release job
# installs them while it holds the Developer ID key, so every transitive dependency is pinned by
# hash in dmgbuild-requirements.txt. After changing this file, regenerate that file with the
# command at its top, and keep the hash of every wheel (pyobjc ships one per CPython version).
dmgbuild[badge_icons]==1.6.7
